DRIVES

Lists additional data drives that may be managed by the user.
The boot/system drive is intentionally excluded.

Usage:
    drives

Drive numbering is zero-based: the first manageable drive is Drive0.
If a drive has partitions, their FORMAT indexes are also zero-based (0 through partitions-1).

Typical workflow:
    drives
    partition 0 1
    format 0 0 fat32 --yes
    drivename 0 Data
